---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../styles/lieflat.css";
const rules = [
  [
    "BED / 资源核心",
    "先找床，再发育。",
    "走到空床旁，点击上床躺下。",
    "睡眠产金币，升级床铺提高产出。",
  ],
  [
    "DOOR / 生存底线",
    "门，别让它破。",
    "上床后开始布置房内防线。",
    "升级与修复房门，延长生存时间。",
  ],
  [
    "TOWER / 反击时刻",
    "塔，把压力打回去。",
    "在房间空地放置炮塔。",
    "配合发电设施，抵御后续攻势。",
  ],
];
---

<Layout
  title="躺平发育"
  description="人已躺平，防线拉满。走进宿舍，找空床、攒资源，体验一局本地宿舍生存塔防原型。"
>
  <main class="dorm">
    <nav class="d-nav" aria-label="躺平发育导航">
      <div class="d-wrap">
        <a href="/" aria-label="NewPlay 首页"
          ><img src="/assets/newplay-logo.svg" alt="NewPlay" /></a
        ><strong>躺平发育</strong><a href="#lab">战术实验室</a><a href="#rules"
          >生存法则</a
        ><a href="#rank">今夜生存榜</a><a href="/games/">返回好玩宇宙 ↗</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <section class="d-hero">
      <div class="d-hero-inner">
        <div
          class="d-art"
          role="img"
          aria-label="夜色中普莱躺在自己的宿舍防线内"
        >
        </div><div class="d-copy">
          <small>宿舍生存塔防　/　PvE</small><h1>躺平发育</h1><h2>
            人已躺平，<br />防线拉满。
          </h2><p>
            开始游戏，跑进宿舍找空床。<br />躺下攒资源，升门、建塔守住这一夜。
          </p><a class="cut-btn" href="#lab">开始游戏 <span>↗</span></a><a
            class="rule-link"
            href="#rules">先看生存法则　↓</a
          ><small class="d-note">玩法概念页 · 可点击交互演示</small>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="ticker">
      <div class="d-wrap">
        开始游戏　↗　移动找空床　↗　上床产金币　↗　升门建塔
      </div>
    </div>
    <section id="lab" class="lab">
      <div class="d-wrap">
        <small>NIGHT SHIFT / 先试一局</small><div class="d-sectionhead">
          <h2>这一间，<br />我来守。</h2><p>
            先开始，再操控普莱走进宿舍找空床。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="d-console" tabindex="-1" aria-label="宿舍玩法演示">
          <header>
            <b id="d-board">NIGHT SHIFT / 宿舍走廊</b><b id="d-step">00 / 06</b>
          </header><div class="d-grid">
            <div class="map" data-phase="Start">
              <div class="wallet">
                <b id="coins">●　0</b><b id="energy">ϟ　0</b>
              </div><h3 id="map-title">熄灯前，<br />先跑起来。</h3><img
                id="d-plai"
                src="/assets/games/dorm-plai.webp"
                alt="普莱"
              /><button id="map-action" hidden></button><span
                id="map-alert"
                hidden></span><i id="turret" hidden aria-hidden="true"
              ></i><small id="map-note">先走动，找到空床，再上床。</small>
            </div>
            <div class="d-controller">
              <small id="d-label">START / 开始这一局</small><h3 id="d-title">
                先开始，<br />再去找床。
              </h3><p id="d-body" aria-live="polite">
                按下开始，普莱出现在走廊。<br />自己走去找空床，躺下后再筑防线。
              </p><div class="controller">
                <div class="keys">
                  {
                    [
                      ["up", "↑", "上"],
                      ["left", "←", "左"],
                      ["right", "→", "右"],
                      ["down", "↓", "下"],
                    ].map(([dir, arrow, label]) => (
                      <button
                        type="button"
                        data-move={dir}
                        aria-label={"向" + label + "移动"}
                        disabled
                      >
                        {arrow}
                      </button>
                    ))
                  }
                </div><span>方向键 / WASD<br />或点击方向控件移动</span>
              </div><button id="d-next" class="cut-btn"
                ><b>开始游戏</b><span>↗</span></button
              ><button id="d-fail" hidden>查看失守分支 ↗</button><small
                class="d-note">交互演示 · 不提交成绩或发放奖励</small>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <small class="fine"
          >交互演示 · 数值为界面样例；正式规则以产品确认为准。</small
        ><p class="instruction">
          点击「开始游戏」，用方向控件移动；走到空床旁，再上床躺下。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="rules" class="rules">
      <div class="d-wrap">
        <small>生存法则 / 资源都要花在刀刃上</small><h2>
          先跑，找空床。<br />躺下，才发育。
        </h2><div class="equipment">
          {
            rules.map(([label, title, a, b], i) => (
              <article>
                <>
                  <div
                    class="equipment-art"
                    style={"--position:" + i * 50 + "%"}
                  />
                  <div class="num">0{i + 1}</div>
                  <small>{label}</small>
                  <h3>{title}</h3>
                  <p>
                    {a}
                    <br />
                    {b}
                  </p>
                </>
              </article>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="d-agent">
      <div class="d-wrap">
        <strong aria-hidden="true">PLAI</strong><h2>
          你负责躺。<br />我负责出主意。
        </h2><p>
          先升门，还是先补一座炮塔？<br />PLAI 帮你读懂资源与防线的取舍。
        </p><a href="#lab">进入战术实验室　↗</a><small
          >仅练习 / PvE辅助；不计入真人挑战榜。</small>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="rank" id="rank">
      <div class="d-wrap">
        <small>每一秒，都算你的本事。</small><div class="d-sectionhead">
          <h2>今夜生存榜</h2><p>真人挑战与 Agent 练习分开展示。</p>
        </div><div class="rank-tabs">
          <button aria-pressed="true" data-league="human">真人挑战</button
          ><button aria-pressed="false" data-league="agent">Agent 练习</button>
        </div><div class="podium">
          {
            [
              ["02", "夜猫选手B", "09:21", "left"],
              ["01", "梦游选手A", "09:48", "center"],
              ["03", "守门选手C", "08:56", "right"],
            ].map(([n, name, time, color]) => (
              <article>
                <>
                  <strong>{n}</strong>
                  <b data-human={name} data-agent={"PLAI练习舱" + n}>
                    {name}
                  </b>
                  <span
                    style={
                      "background-image:url(/assets/games/podium-" +
                      color +
                      ".svg)"
                    }
                  >
                    {time}
                    <small>守夜时长</small>
                  </span>
                </>
              </article>
            ))
          }
        </div>
        <div class="runners">
          {
            [
              ["04", "08:32"],
              ["05", "08:05"],
              ["06", "07:48"],
              ["07", "07:26"],
            ].map(([n, time]) => (
              <div>
                <>
                  <b>{n}</b>
                  <b
                    data-human={"示例守夜人 " + Number(n)}
                    data-agent={"PLAI练习样例 " + Number(n)}
                  >
                    示例守夜人 {Number(n)}
                  </b>
                  <b>{time}</b>
                </>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div><div class="mobile-position">
          <small>我的守夜记录</small><h3>尚未上榜</h3><p>
            未连接真实账号<br />进入正式游戏后再查看成绩。
          </p>
        </div><small class="mobile-disclosure"
          >真人榜不接收 Agent 辅助成绩。</small
        ><small>榜单为虚构布局样例，不代表真实用户成绩。</small>
      </div>
    </section>
    <footer class="d-footer">
      <div class="d-wrap">
        <h2>晚安，<br />明天继续开局。</h2><a href="/games/"
          >回到 NewPlay 好玩宇宙　↗</a
        ><small>NewPlay · 玩法概念与交互原型</small>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </main></Layout
>
<script src="../scripts/games/dorm.ts"></script>
